FINAL ANSWER:
**Short answer: Troy Goode is the person to review changes to `lib/index.js`, and no one else is currently active in this file.** You have no diff yet, so I ran `--reviewers` on the file rather than `--for-diff`. Once the change is committed, `--for-diff <base>..<head>` will show who wrote the lines it replaces.

Troy Goode holds the file. The identity split is the first thing to know:

- **Merged, as one person (strong guess):** 144 lines (67.3%) of 214 non-blank lines, 159 of 238 counting blank lines (66.8%). The guess rests on the two addresses `<email redacted>` and `troy@laptop.example`. Only you can confirm it's one person.
- **Unmerged:** `<email redacted>` holds 132 lines (61.7%); `troy@laptop.example` holds 12 (5.6%), with its last commit on 2026-04-10.

The tool's output line for the top author reads: `top: Troy Goode <<email redacted>> holds 132 non-blank lines (61.7%), 147 counting blank lines (61.8%)`.

**Other owners, all inactive in this file:**
- Douglas Christopher Wilson: 20 lines (9.3%), last commit 2017-10-04.
- Alejandro Caravaca Puchades: 14 lines (6.5%), last commit 2015-05-28. The same address also appears as `alex94puchades`, which the tool counts as one name.
- LuisEGR: 6 lines (2.8%), last commit 2021-07-20.

**Risk:**
- Bus factor is 1 for this file: Troy Goode alone holds 61.7% of the non-blank lines (50% is the threshold). Four authors are needed to reach 80%.
- As of 2026-04-12, 1 of 18 authors committed in the last 365 days, and they hold 67.3% of the non-blank lines; 32.7% belong to people with no commit in that time.
- The file is not orphaned: the top owner is active.

**Second reviewer:** The tool names no second active owner. Since `lib/index.js` is one file, nobody else has a half share of it. The only option from the history is Douglas Christopher Wilson, who is inactive here, so a second reviewer would have to come from outside the repository's history.

**Lines credited elsewhere:**
- 11 lines from `e64e854` ("Allow array of matching conditions as options.origin") are credited to Alejandro Caravaca Puchades, though Troy Goode committed them.
- 6 lines from `f038e77` ("lint: remove unused function parameters") are credited to LuisEGR, though Douglas Christopher Wilson committed them.

**Left out:** The tool did not set aside any mechanical rewrites in this file. One commit, `fcd2b56` ("issue #42: (WIP) switch to ESLint; clean up", Troy Goode, 6 surviving lines), looks mechanical but was not set aside. Inspect it with `git show --stat fcd2b56`.

Counts come from `surviving-lines --reviewers lib/index.js` at HEAD (9f866e1). The analysis is on lines, not on who understands the code.

=== ANSWER B ===
COMMANDS RUN:
 - Bash: ls -a && echo --- && cat CODEOWNERS .github/CODEOWNERS docs/CODEOWNERS 2>/dev/null; echo --- && git log --format='%an <%ae> %ad %s' --date=short -n 20 -- lib/index.js && echo --- && git shortlog -sne HEAD -- lib/index.js && echo --- && git blame --line-porcelain lib/index.js 2>/dev/null | grep '^author ' | sort | uniq -c | sort -rn | head
 - Bash: find .github -type f && echo --- && grep -n -i '"author"\|maintainers\|contributors' package.json; echo ---; grep -n -i 'maint\|review\|contribut' README.md HISTORY.md | head -20
FINAL ANSWER:
There's no formal owner for `lib/index.js`. The repo has no CODEOWNERS file, no contributing guide, and no review policy. So the choice is yours, based on history.

- **Troy Goode** is the best pick for logic changes. They're the package author in `package.json`, and they wrote 20 of the file's line-level changes, including the handler annotations commit (`b2005d9`) and earlier CORS behaviour fixes.
- **Douglas Christopher Wilson** has the most recent substantive logic work, such as the `Vary` header fixes in 2017. They're a good second reviewer if the change touches headers or preflight handling, but they haven't committed to this file since 2017.
- **Fiona Formatter** shows as the top blamer (214 lines), but only because of the recent reformat commit (`62628c0`). Don't pick them for review on that basis. Running `git blame --ignore-revs-file .git-blame-ignore-revs lib/index.js` will show the real authors.

If you want a non-author check, Tom Arad and Tomek Kopczuk have each made a single fix to this file (maxAge handling and `Vary: Origin`).

